<h1 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3; color: #1f1b13;">Reset your password</h1>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Hi,</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Someone asked to reset the password for your WIT Calendar account (<strong><%= @resource.email %></strong>).</p>

<%= render "shared/mailer_button", url: edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), label: "Reset my password" %>

<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4d4639;">
  If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email.
  Your password does not change until you open the link and set a new one.
</p>
